  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="Tag1" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;In the first quarter of 2025, Plains Oryx Permian Basin Pipeline LLC acquired EMG Medallion 2 Holdings, LLC and its subsidiaries, which own a crude oil gathering and transportation business in the Delaware Basin. Following this acquisition, Medallion Delaware Express, LLC was renamed MDE Midstream, LLC.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;"&gt;None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;None&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag2" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: .25in;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;In the first quarter of 2025, Plains Oryx Permian Basin Pipeline LLC acquired EMG Medallion 2 Holdings, LLC and its subsidiaries, which own a crude oil gathering and transportation business in the Delaware Basin. Following this acquisition, Medallion Delaware Express, LLC was renamed MDE Midstream, LLC.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
