    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote14" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">The management of the business and affairs of MDE Midstream LLC ("the Company") is fully vested in the Members. To facilitate the management of the Company, the Members act as a "committee of the whole" referred to as the "Board". The designated Board Members are listed on pages 104 and 105.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
